LOAN AGREEMENT

WHEREAS, on January 14, 2021, NORTHBRIDGE CAPITAL PARTNERS LIMITED, a limited company incorporated under the laws of England and Wales (the "Parent Company"), and its wholly-owned subsidiary, GREENOAK TECHNOLOGIES INC., a corporation incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware (the "Borrower"), desire to enter into a loan agreement (this "Agreement") for the benefit of the Borrower; and

WHEREAS, the LENDER, CITIGROUP GLOBAL MARKETS LIMITED, a limited company incorporated under the laws of Ireland (the "Lender"), has agreed to provide the Borrower with a loan facility (the "Loan") on the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement;

NOW, THEREFORE, in consideration of the premises and the mutual covenants and agreements contained herein, the parties agree as follows:

1. DEFINITIONS

1.1 "Agreement" means this Loan Agreement, including all schedules, exhibits, and amendments thereto.

1.2 "Borrower" means GREENOAK TECHNOLOGIES INC., a corporation incorporated under the laws of the State of Delaware.

1.3 "Lender" means CITIGROUP GLOBAL MARKETS LIMITED, a limited company incorporated under the laws of Ireland.

1.4 "Loan" means the loan facility provided by the Lender to the Borrower in the aggregate principal amount of $50,000,000.

2. LOAN TERMS

2.1 The Loan shall be disbursed in two tranches: (a) an initial tranche of $25,000,000, which shall be disbursed on January 15, 2021, and (b) a second tranche of $25,000,000, which shall be disbursed on February 15, 2021.

2.2 The Loan shall bear interest at a rate of 4.5% per annum, compounded quarterly.

2.3 The Borrower shall repay the Loan in 36 equal monthly installments of $1,388,889, commencing on March 15, 2021.

3. INTEREST AND FEES

3.1 The Borrower shall pay interest on the outstanding principal balance of the Loan at the rate of 4.5% per annum, compounded quarterly.

3.2 The Borrower shall pay a commitment fee of 0.5% per annum on the undrawn portion of the Loan, payable quarterly.

4. DEFAULT AND REMEDIES

4.1 If the Borrower fails to make any payment when due, the Lender may, without notice or demand, declare the Loan to be in default and exercise any or all of the remedies set forth in this Agreement.

4.2 In the event of default, the Lender may, without limitation, accelerate the Loan, require immediate repayment of the outstanding principal balance, and exercise any other rights and remedies available to it under applicable law.

5. SIGNATURES

5.1 The parties hereto have executed this Agreement as of the date first above written.

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have executed this Agreement as of the date first above written.

